flowchart TD
    A[Pi Camera / Synthetic Source] --> B[pi/video/streamer.py]
    B --> C[JPEG encode]
    C --> D[Chunk packets + heartbeat\nUDP 5000]
    D --> E[UDPVideoReceiver socket poll]
    E --> F[FrameBuffer reassembly]
    F --> G[render_queue]
    G --> H[Render worker]
    H --> I{Inference enabled?}
    I -->|yes| J[InferenceEngine + YOLO.track]
    I -->|no| K[Decode/display only]
    J --> L[ui_queue frame event]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Tk label update]
    M --> N[GUI stats callback\nfps/frame/detections]
